      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 36 Corbally Avenue to the market a charming and spacious 3-bedroom semi-detached family home, ideally located in the heart of the prestigious and highly sought-after Corbally development in Citywest, County Dublin.\nThis well-proportioned property offers an excellent opportunity for buyers to put their own stamp on a superb family home in a prime location. Spanning approximately 99 sq. m, the ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and airy dual-aspect living/dining room, a kitchen/dining room with separate utility room and a convenient understairs W/C. Upstairs, you'll find three generously sized double bedrooms, a main family bathroom and ensuite leading from the master bedroom.\nTo the rear, a low-maintenance private rear garden offers an outdoor space ideal for relaxing or entertaining, with excellent evening sun.\nNo. 36 enjoys a prime position within Citywest. Just a short stroll away is Citywest Village, offering a range of local amenities. The nearby Citywest Shopping Centre features a large Dunnes Stores, cafés, and an Energie Fitness Gym. Families will appreciate the abundance of primary and secondary schools located within a 5km radius.\nFor commuters, the location is second to none the Red Line Luas is within walking distance and provides direct access to Dublin City Centre in under 30 minutes. The Luas also connects to the Dublin Airport shuttle at Red Cow, making the airport accessible in just 20 minutes. Major road networks, including the N7 and M50, are easily reached, and several Dublin Bus routes (77X, 77A, and 65B) serve the area.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended a fantastic opportunity to secure a spacious family home in one of Citywest's most desirable locations.\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing.\nFeatures \n<ul>\n <li>3 bed, 3 bath</li>\n <li>Semi-detached</li>\n <li>99 sqm</li>\n <li>Built c.1983</li>\n <li>Double glazed windows</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Low maintenance private rear garden</li>\n <li>N7 & M50 motorway within an incredibly close proximity</li>\n <li>Luas red line within walking distance</li>\n <li>Citywest village within walking distance</li>\n <li>Early viewing highly recommended</li>\n</ul>\nBER details\nBER: C\nDirections\nEircode: D24E37K"
      },
      {
